// Title: User Added To Highly Privileged Group
// Rule ID: 10fb649c-3600-4d37-b1e6-56ea90bb7e09
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1098
// Category: process_creation
